# Film 5 of still.fail in use on the iPhone Duo simulator, in English: a chat that came from Slack (someone there @'d the
# agent), its agent asking to use the production key in Lin's vault: allowed on Lin's folded phone's outer screen, the vault unlocked with Lin's finger; its fix goes back to
# the thread and its asker answers from Slack (story scripts/story/iduo-slack-en.json, FILM_LANG=en
# FILM_STORY=iduo-slack-en). It never unfolds.
timeout 45000
until Message
wait 1200
# (the chat open on the outer screen before the film starts: the phone is first seen with the card already in it)
# (the list over the chat closed with a tap on the chat beside it, on Ana's message, clear of the card)
tapxy 430 130
until =Allow
wait 800
at start
# (the computer's Slack first: Ana typing her question, the agent at work, its ask for Lin's key)
wait 7800
at read
wait 1800
at tap=deploy
tap =Allow
# (the vault unlocked as the core unlocks it: the system's prompt, a finger on the sensor)
wait 2000
at finger
log FINGER
wait 1500
at decided
until Fixed and live
at answer
wait 1500
until Works now
at merged
wait 3500
at end
exit
